      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors determine the cost of packers and movers Bangalore to Bijapur bike shipping?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost is influenced by bike size and weight, distance (approximately 850 km), type of packaging (standard vs. 7‑layer foam), insurance coverage level, and any special handling requirements. Seasonal demand and expedited delivery windows may also affect pricing, all of which are reflected in the transparent quote you receive.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is full‑value insurance included in the bike parcel service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every bike shipped from Bangalore to Bijapur is covered by IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance for 100 % of the declared value. The policy protects against loss, theft, or damage during transit, and claims are processed quickly through our dedicated support team.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my bike secured during loading and transit on the hydraulic ramp trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our technicians use a hydraulic ramp to gently lift the bike onto an enclosed multi‑car trailer equipped with high‑tensile ratchet lashings and wheel chocks. The bike is then wrapped in our 7‑layer foam system, ensuring it remains immobile and protected from vibrations, scratches, and weather throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Bangalore to Bijapur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each shipment is fitted with a GPS tracker linked to our live monitoring portal. You receive instant updates via SMS or email, showing the bike’s exact location, estimated arrival time, and any transit alerts, giving you complete visibility from pickup to doorstep delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike parcel booking between Bangalore and Bijapur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid bike registration certificate, a government‑issued ID proof, and a signed consignment note. If the move is for corporate or government reimbursement, provide the relevant bill of lading and GST invoice. Our team assists in preparing all paperwork to ensure smooth customs‑free interstate transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical delivery time for bike transport from Bangalore to Bijapur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad guarantees a 24‑48 hour door‑to‑door delivery for bike parcels on the Bangalore‑to‑Bijapur route. This rapid timeline is achieved through dedicated routing, priority loading, and continuous GPS monitoring, ensuring your bike arrives on schedule without compromising safety.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
